# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:204
translate schinese ep10_fr1_josy_event_label_a2b0b46f:

    # js "But that doesn't make things perfect because it's not the entire truth."
    js "但这并不能让一切变得完美，因为这并不是全部的真相。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:206
translate schinese ep10_fr1_josy_event_label_c773cd18:

    # mc "But we can't tell the truth; we have to lie about it."
    mc "但我们不能说真话，得编个借口。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:207
translate schinese ep10_fr1_josy_event_label_2b16c9fc:

    # mc "At least this way, we don't have to sneak around in public."
    mc "至少这样我们就不必在公众场合偷偷摸摸了。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:209
translate schinese ep10_fr1_josy_event_label_2f746357:

    # js "It makes Maya and me look bad, though. Don't you think?"
    js "这让我们俩看起来都不太好，你觉得呢？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:211
translate schinese ep10_fr1_josy_event_label_91905ede:

    # mc "How?"
    mc "怎么？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:213
translate schinese ep10_fr1_josy_event_label_287d0ca6:

    # js "It's like we don't have integrity. We just \"had to have you\"."
    js "这就像是我们根本没有诚信，我们只是“不得不让你”这样。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:215
translate schinese ep10_fr1_josy_event_label_a7204671:

    # mc "That's what {b}you{/b} told Elena."
    mc "那是什么{b}你{/b}告诉 Elena。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:217
translate schinese ep10_fr1_josy_event_label_53a22e2f:

    # js "Because that's what it looks like. That's the only way it can look without people knowing about Maya and me. Don't you get it?"
    js "因为看起来就是这样。这是在人们不知道Maya和我之间的事的情况下，唯一可能的解释。你没懂吗？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:219
translate schinese ep10_fr1_josy_event_label_85f797d4:

    # mc "*{i}Sigh{/i}* Yes..."
    mc "*{i}叹气{/i}*是的……"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:221
translate schinese ep10_fr1_josy_event_label_6180c73c:

    # js "And that's one of the reasons it doesn't feel good for Maya in particular."
    js "而且这也是为什么对Maya来说，感觉特别不爽的原因之一。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:222
translate schinese ep10_fr1_josy_event_label_12106097:

    # js "She's also afraid that her dad will find out. I told her she didn't have to fear that."
    js "她也怕她爸爸会发现。我跟她说她没必要这么担心。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:223
translate schinese ep10_fr1_josy_event_label_ee69fa3e:

    # js "I mean, how would he figure it out? He doesn't know or talk to anyone on campus aside from Maya and Derek."
    js "我的意思是，他怎么知道的？他除了Maya和Derek之外，根本没人认识。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:225
translate schinese ep10_fr1_josy_event_label_4a39287a:

    # mc "I feel bad now."
    mc "我现在感觉很糟。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:227
translate schinese ep10_fr1_josy_event_label_2f55ac46:

    # js "You should talk to her about this."
    js "你应该和她谈谈这件事。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:229
translate schinese ep10_fr1_josy_event_label_dac16979:

    # mc "I will."
    mc "我同意。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:231
translate schinese ep10_fr1_josy_event_label_a2442024:

    # js "But don't feel too bad. It's scary that people know about it, but it's kinda good too."
    js "但别太难受。人们知道这件事确实挺吓人的，但某种程度上也挺好的。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:232
translate schinese ep10_fr1_josy_event_label_cae52f29:

    # js "If it works out, we won't have to sneak around that much anymore."
    js "如果能成事，我们以后就不需要躲躲闪闪了。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:236
translate schinese ep10_fr1_josy_event_label_f2e56310:

    # mc "You're right. We'd only have to be careful around a few people - like Tommy and Maya's dad."
    mc "你说得对。我们只需要在少数人面前小心点——比如Tommy和梅娅的爸爸。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:238
translate schinese ep10_fr1_josy_event_label_b9ba4163:

    # js "Right."
    js "对。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:241
translate schinese ep10_fr1_josy_event_label_e361002b:

    # mc "Yeah. And I could do this in public, too."
    mc "是啊，而且我在公共场合也能这样做。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:243
translate schinese ep10_fr1_josy_event_label_90545c3e:

    # mc "*{i}Smack{/i}*"
    mc "*{i}亲吻{/i}*"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:245
translate schinese ep10_fr1_josy_event_label_9dcd3bc6:

    # js "..."
    js "..."

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:250
translate schinese ep10_fr1_josy_event_label_daeec95b:

    # mc "And I already miss it."
    mc "我还挺想它的。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:252
translate schinese ep10_fr1_josy_event_label_5db51bb9:

    # js "Miss what?"
    js "想什么呢？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:254
translate schinese ep10_fr1_josy_event_label_79e04043:

    # mc "Your hair let loose."
    mc "你的头发散开了。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:256
translate schinese ep10_fr1_josy_event_label_add59d82:

    # js "When I woke up today, I looked like a big mess. I had to put it in a ponytail."
    js "我今天醒来的时候，头发乱得像一团糟，只好扎了个马尾。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:262
translate schinese ep10_fr1_josy_event_label_b85d607a:

    # mc "It's not bad; it means I can do this."
    mc "这不算什么；这意味着我可以这么做。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:264
translate schinese ep10_fr1_josy_event_label_7bfb6037:

    # js "Hey!"
    js "嘿！"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:267
translate schinese ep10_fr1_josy_event_label_201e9280:

    # js "Damn you."
    js "该死的。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:269
translate schinese ep10_fr1_josy_event_label_420dd968:

    # mc "Haha, sorry."
    mc "哈哈，抱歉。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:271
translate schinese ep10_fr1_josy_event_label_e076b286:

    # mc "Well, you look great with that, too."
    mc "嗯，你这样也挺好看的。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:273
translate schinese ep10_fr1_josy_event_label_938d25d6:

    # js "Thanks, [name]. But today, no one is looking great."
    js "谢谢[name]但今天，没人看起来很好。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:274
translate schinese ep10_fr1_josy_event_label_efa7097c:

    # js "We all look like we haven't slept for more than two hours."
    js "我们看起来都像熬了两个钟头没睡。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:276
translate schinese ep10_fr1_josy_event_label_4007e880:

    # mc "Thirsty?"
    mc "渴了？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:278
translate schinese ep10_fr1_josy_event_label_7ec75d4a:

    # js "I can't even look at that without wanting to puke."
    js "我连看一眼都差点想吐。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:279
translate schinese ep10_fr1_josy_event_label_e0009078:

    # js "I drank too many weird drinks yesterday."
    js "我昨天喝太多了奇怪的饮料。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:281
translate schinese ep10_fr1_josy_event_label_de0cdf67:

    # mc "I'm amazed we still have some alcohol left, with how much people were drinking."
    mc "真没想到我们还能剩下点酒，大家喝得也太狠了。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:283
translate schinese ep10_fr1_josy_event_label_5050e23c:

    # js "Leftover beer is good. You can save it for another one of your parties."
    js "剩下啤酒不错，可以留着下次你聚会用。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:286
translate schinese ep10_fr1_josy_event_label_c37b8a50:

    # mc "Yeah, whenever that will happen."
    mc "那什么时候会发生呢。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:287
translate schinese ep10_fr1_josy_event_label_83b2ba73:

    # mc "Tomorrow, I have to get back into college mode..."
    mc "明天，我得重新进入大学模式了……"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:289
translate schinese ep10_fr1_josy_event_label_129ffe32:

    # mc "I don't want to think about planning another party yet."
    mc "我还不想急着计划下一次聚会呢。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:290
translate schinese ep10_fr1_josy_event_label_a949d6c7:

    # mc "Tomorrow, I'm back into college mode."
    mc "明天，我得重新进入大学模式了。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:292
translate schinese ep10_fr1_josy_event_label_e0480b64:

    # js "I'm starting to miss classes. Is that weird?"
    js "我开始想念上课了。这很奇怪吗？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:294
translate schinese ep10_fr1_josy_event_label_5c2ddb3e:

    # mc "I'll tell you something I don't miss... Gender Studies."
    mc "我最不怀念的东西……性别研究课。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:296
translate schinese ep10_fr1_josy_event_label_def1b7b3:

    # js "Haha!"
    js "哈哈！"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:304
translate schinese ep10_fr1_nick_event_label_768dbef1:

    # ni "Fuck..."
    ni "操"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:306
translate schinese ep10_fr1_nick_event_label_f3b3d28f:

    # mc "What's wrong?"
    mc "怎么了？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:308
translate schinese ep10_fr1_nick_event_label_558bb100:

    # ni "Some of the bottles leaked onto the tank, but hopefully not into it."
    ni "一些瓶子漏到了水箱上，但希望没漏进去。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:310
translate schinese ep10_fr1_nick_event_label_3d530099:

    # mc "Those fish don't look drunk to me."
    mc "这些鱼看起来一点都不像喝醉了。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:312
translate schinese ep10_fr1_nick_event_label_aa829325:

    # ni "They would be dead, not drunk."
    ni "他们早就死了，不是喝醉了。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:314
translate schinese ep10_fr1_nick_event_label_528df36f:

    # mc "From a little bit of beer?"
    mc "从一点点啤酒？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:316
translate schinese ep10_fr1_nick_event_label_68b7c7e1:

    # ni "I don't intend to find out how much beer will kill them. I'm trying to keep them alive."
    ni "我没打算弄清楚需要多少啤酒才能杀死它们。我是在努力让它们活下去。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:318
translate schinese ep10_fr1_nick_event_label_51809e89:

    # ni "I remember you said you wanted to help out with it. Are you still interested?"
    ni "我记得你之前说过你想帮忙。你还在意吗？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:320
translate schinese ep10_fr1_nick_event_label_8721ba31:

    # mc "Of course! What do you need me to do?"
    mc "当然！你让我做什么？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:323
translate schinese ep10_fr1_nick_event_label_ea2d566f:

    # ni "I know you don't want to help out with it, but I could use a hand from someone... Can I change your mind somehow?"
    ni "我知道你不想帮忙，可我需要找个人……有什么办法能让你改变主意吗？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:328
translate schinese ep10_fr1_nick_event_label_f73d31a8:

    # mc "I mean...if you really need someone to help, I'll do it. But I thought you'd be able to take care of it by yourself."
    mc "我是说……如果你真的需要有人帮忙，我去做就是了。但我以为你有能力自己搞定。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:330
translate schinese ep10_fr1_nick_event_label_763a66c8:

    # ni "I thought I could, too, but it's a lot of work. And I don't think the fish are feeling well."
    ni "我也这么想过的，但其实挺费劲的。而且我觉得鱼好像不太舒服。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:332
translate schinese ep10_fr1_nick_event_label_c22fe017:

    # mc "What do you need me to do?"
    mc "你让我做什么？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:335
translate schinese ep10_fish_intro_label_0cd9e97c:

    # ni "I'm kind of a rookie when it comes to this. I thought it would be cool to have fish when I saw this tank among the stuff your dad brought us."
    ni "我其实对养鱼这种事还挺新手的。我本来以为看到你爸爸带来的那个鱼缸，养鱼应该挺酷的。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:336
translate schinese ep10_fish_intro_label_2ba8807a:

    # ni "But I'm worried I don't have what it takes to take care of it."
    ni "但我担心自己可能没那个本事照顾好它。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:338
translate schinese ep10_fish_intro_label_34d57bc8:

    # mc "I thought you knew how to do it."
    mc "我以为你懂怎么弄。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:340
translate schinese ep10_fish_intro_label_9d32a8aa:

    # ni "Me and my sis had a smaller tank when I was younger and lived back home. But this one is next level."
    ni "我和我妹妹以前在家的时候有个小一点的鱼缸，但这个可是升级版。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:341
translate schinese ep10_fish_intro_label_4d4b68a4:

    # ni "It looks empty without any stuff in it. And I haven't bought an air pump yet."
    ni "看起来里面什么都没放，而且我还没买气泵呢。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:342
translate schinese ep10_fish_intro_label_fbf4f165:

    # ni "The water looks kind of murky, too, and I think I've put too many fish in it."
    ni "水看起来有点浑浊，而且我觉得我放的鱼太多了。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:344
translate schinese ep10_fish_intro_label_019a50a1:

    # mc "So, they'll die unless we do something about it?"
    mc "所以它们会死，除非我们想办法？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:346
translate schinese ep10_fish_intro_label_39ddb78e:

    # ni "Probably. It would be a horror show, so I want to do something about it before it's too late."
    ni "大概率会。那场面会很惨，所以我得在事情变得更糟之前想办法解决。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:347
translate schinese ep10_fish_intro_label_90da7a97:

    # ni "I read they can get diseases, too, unless they are taken care of properly."
    ni "鱼儿也会得病，除非它们得到妥善照顾。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:349
translate schinese ep10_fish_intro_label_5eb9a8b7:

    # mc "That sounds bad. How should we do it?"
    mc "这听起来挺糟的。我们该怎么做？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:358
translate schinese ep10_fish_intro_label_1aebadec:

    # ni "Ok. Maybe that's good enough? I don't know. Check up on them whenever you want. You know where to find them."
    ni "好。也许这样就差不多了？我不知道。你想什么时候去看看就什么时候去。你知道他们在哪里。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:360
translate schinese ep10_fish_intro_label_655f1f57:

    # mc "Great, I'll do that."
    mc "好，我干了。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:365
translate schinese ep10_fish_intro_label_3fd54a0c:

    # ni "How about this? If you help me feed them once or twice daily and help out with the expenses for equipment and stuff..."
    ni "这样如何？你每天帮我喂它们一两次，再分担一些设备之类的开销……"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:366
translate schinese ep10_fish_intro_label_3f5523fd:

    # ni "And maybe help me clean the tank once in a while, then I'll fix the rest."
    ni "顺便帮我偶尔清理一下鱼缸，那我其他的就都解决了。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:375
translate schinese ep10_ft_nm_return1_label_8da9e177:

    # mc "That sounds good to me. I'll make sure to check up on them and talk to you about what needs to be done."
    mc "这听起来不错。我会照看它们的，有事再和你商量。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:377
translate schinese ep10_ft_nm_return1_label_949a5fb3:

    # ni "Thanks, bro."
    ni "谢谢，兄弟。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:381
translate schinese ep10_ft_nm_return1_label_50778a4b:

    # mc "Sorry, but you should ask someone else. I wouldn't be of much help taking care of them."
    mc "抱歉，但你还是找别人吧。我照顾它们应该帮不上什么忙。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:382
translate schinese ep10_ft_nm_return1_label_a7339d36:

    # mc "Maybe Derek can help you? His room is right next to it anyway."
    mc "也许Derek能帮你？他的房间就在旁边。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:384
translate schinese ep10_ft_nm_return1_label_7154f8d2:

    # ni "Ok... I'll ask him instead."
    ni "那我去找他问问吧。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:388
translate schinese ep10_ft_nm_return1_label_832cd82d:

    # mc "By the way... Thanks for...um...that thing with Bella."
    mc "顺便说一句...谢谢你在贝拉那件事上的帮忙。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:390
translate schinese ep10_ft_nm_return1_label_b7918ce3:

    # ni "With who?"
    ni "跟谁？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:392
translate schinese ep10_ft_nm_return1_label_15152055:

    # mc "Bella, you know, from my room earlier."
    mc "贝拉，就是我之前房间里的那个。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:394
translate schinese ep10_ft_nm_return1_label_3f026830:

    # ni "Yeah, I know. I meant, \"with who?\" Get it?"
    ni "嗯，我知道。我问的是‘和谁’，明白吗？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:396
translate schinese ep10_ft_nm_return1_label_0b962c21:

    # mc "Oh. Thanks. It means a lot."
    mc "哦，谢谢。这对我来说意义很大。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:399
translate schinese ep10_ft_nm_return1_label_6e55130a:

    # mc "Oh, yeah... Another thing."
    mc "哦，对了……还有件事。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:402
translate schinese ep10_ft_nm_return1_label_2d678b94:

    # mc "By the way..."
    mc "顺便说一句..."

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:403
translate schinese ep10_ft_nm_return1_label_374895d3:

    # mc "Vinny was here last night."
    mc "Vinny昨晚来过这里。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:405
translate schinese ep10_ft_nm_return1_label_ad333ea2:

    # ni "Yeah, I heard it from Tommy. I must have missed him."
    ni "嗯，我听Tommy说的。我大概和他错过了。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:407
translate schinese ep10_ft_nm_return1_label_e4d21602:

    # mc "Oh. I thought it was you who invited him."
    mc "哦，我本来以为是你请他的。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:409
translate schinese ep10_ft_nm_return1_label_f21f4030:

    # ni "No, it wasn't me. I was actually surprised that he showed up."
    ni "不是我。我其实还挺意外他居然来了。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:410
translate schinese ep10_ft_nm_return1_label_4adc597c:

    # ni "He must have patched things up with Tommy when Tommy...uh..."
    ni "他肯定跟Tommy和好啦，就在Tommy……呃……"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:412
translate schinese ep10_ft_nm_return1_label_aa32c20f:

    # mc "When Tommy what?"
    mc "当Tommy怎么了？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:414
translate schinese ep10_ft_nm_return1_label_8135afcb:

    # ni "Don't talk about this with people, but Tommy's buying weed from Vinny."
    ni "别告诉别人，Tommy在从Vinny那里买大麻。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:415
translate schinese ep10_ft_nm_return1_label_cc816ad0:

    # ni "Not that long ago, Tommy asked me to reach out to him about it."
    ni "不久之前，Tommy让我联系他这件事。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:417
translate schinese ep10_ft_nm_return1_label_41b0cc30:

    # ni "I guess that's why he showed up."
    ni "我想大概就是这个原因他才出现的。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:419
translate schinese ep10_ft_nm_return1_label_d4d02d14:

    # mc "I gotta say, I didn't think you'd be friends with someone like Vinny."
    mc "说实话，我没想到你会和Vinny那样的人做朋友。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:420
translate schinese ep10_ft_nm_return1_label_9cdde07e:

    # mc "I pictured him being different, but he's a real dick."
    mc "我本来以为他会不一样，结果他真是个混蛋。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:422
translate schinese ep10_ft_nm_return1_label_0e9b3178:

