    ni "发生什么事了？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:424
translate schinese ep10_ft_nm_return1_label_0543e76b:

    # mc "He provoked me, and we had an altercation."
    mc "他挑衅了我，我们吵了起来。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:426
translate schinese ep10_ft_nm_return1_label_4c6835ea:

    # ni "Oh... He does have a short fuse."
    ni "哦……他确实脾气挺急的。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:428
translate schinese ep10_ft_nm_return1_label_42579710:

    # mc "You can say that again. He was being a complete asshole to me for no reason."
    mc "你说得太对了。他无缘无故就像个混蛋一样对待我。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:430
translate schinese ep10_ft_nm_return1_label_5570b005:

    # ni "That sucks to hear. Vinny's always been difficult, but he's changed a lot for the worse lately."
    ni "真他妈烦。Vinny一直都很难相处，最近更是变本加厉。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:431
translate schinese ep10_ft_nm_return1_label_fc3cc652:

    # ni "But I don't think you have to worry about him being around much."
    ni "但我觉得你不用太担心他会在场。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:432
translate schinese ep10_ft_nm_return1_label_85ef168e:

    # ni "Even if he patched things up with Tommy, he's got another life going for him these days, and even I rarely see him."
    ni "就算他和Tommy和好了，他现在还有别的事情要忙，就连我也不太常见到他。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:434
translate schinese ep10_ft_nm_return1_label_40d82eb5:

    # mc "Right. Anyway, thanks for the talk."
    mc "行吧。总之，谢谢你的倾诉。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:445
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_676c9795:

    # sa "And here we are... In the aftermath of a bitching party."
    sa "结果现在我们就在这里……抱怨派对留下的烂摊子。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:446
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_f420f63d:

    # sa "You can tell how fun it was by all the crap we have to clean."
    sa "你能从我们得收拾的烂摊子看出来有多好玩。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:448
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_d859129f:

    # mc "I'm happy you girls are here helping out."
    mc "你们几个能来帮忙真好。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:450
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_0183895c:

    # sa "Of course, dude."
    sa "当然啦。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:453
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_c169cdf3:

    # sa "What are you up to later?"
    sa "晚上有什么安排吗？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:455
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_c1222371:

    # mc "Today? Nothing. Nothing at all. I think I'm gonna rest after this."
    mc "今天？什么都没安排。什么都没干。我想休息一下，就在这之后。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:457
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_6b7cbe9c:

    # sa "If you wanna rest together, you can join me."
    sa "如果你想一起休息，可以来我这儿。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:458
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_69de300a:

    # sa "How about some slow music and lying on the bed together?"
    sa "来点慢节奏的音乐，然后一起躺在床上？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:460
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_1b4cb48a:

    # mc "That sounds like a great evening."
    mc "这听起来是个不错的夜晚。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:473
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_4c908d96:

    # jac "Um... [name]!"
    jac "嗯...[name]!"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:477
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_b664619a:

    # mc "Who the fuck let you guys in?"
    mc "谁他妈让你们进来的？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:479
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_9d83a8e2:

    # mc "What are you doing here?"
    mc "你们在这儿干什么？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:480
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_b51a83ac:

    # mc "Jacob, get the bros."
    mc "Jacob，把兄弟们叫来。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:482
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_11d3835e:

    # dw "We're gonna talk about what happened yesterday. We are PISSED OFF!"
    dw "我们得谈谈昨天发生的事。我们他妈的怒火中烧！"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:484
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_69aa4d43:

    # sa "Don't start anything! We will talk, but not all of us. You know what this will lead to."
    sa "别闹事！我们有话要说，但不是所有人都要参与。你们知道这会闹成什么样子。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:486
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_a0b16d5a:

    # tm "Get the fuck out of here!"
    tm "滚出去！"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:488
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_a0988235:

    # sa "Everyone, relax!"
    sa "大家冷静点！"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:489
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_116967e3:

    # sa "Vice presidents and presidents only. The rest of you leave and tell Quinn to get her ass in here."
    sa "副主席和主席们只有你们留下，其余人全部滚蛋，去告诉Quinn把她那臭屁股叫过来。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:491
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_204dfa78:

    # rs "We don't want these guys in here at all. We're not letting them trash our home again."
    rs "我们可不想这些家伙待在这儿。绝不能让他们再毁了我们的家。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:493
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_b90b83db:

    # dw "I don't know what you're talking about. It wasn't a tri-alpha who did it."
    dw "我不知道你在说什么，那件事不是三阿尔法的人干的。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:495
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_080264c0:

    # tm "Wipe that smug fucking look off your face. We know it was you."
    tm "擦掉你那副得意的狗脸。我们知道是你干的。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:497
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_ce0fb3dc:

    # dw "I dare you to accuse Caleb of it. He's not a tri-alpha or bound by our rules."
    dw "我敢打赌你敢指控 Caleb 做的。他根本不是三阿尔法的一员，也不受我们规矩的约束。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:499
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_11e02f4e:

    # tm "Aha, so that's how you're gonna do it? That shit might fly with the counselors, but it's not gonna work on us."
    tm "啊，原来你是这么打算的？这种把戏可能骗得了辅导员，可别想糊弄过我们。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:501
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_94fb801a:

    # sa "Pipe down. Let's sit down and have a talk somewhere. Rusty? A little help?"
    sa "安静。我们找个地方坐下来谈谈。Rusty？帮个忙？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:503
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_4c62aaac:

    # rs "Let's be civil, for once. We can talk in my room."
    rs "我们先冷静点，这次就讲点道理。我们去我房间谈谈吧。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:509
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_8d21edce:

    # dw "Are you gonna tell us what's up, or will you lie to our faces again?"
    dw "你他妈是打算告诉我们发生了什么，还是打算继续骗我们？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:513
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_058c2447:

    # sa "No one is lying to you. Yes, we had a Halloween party here yesterday, and for obvious reasons, you weren't invited."
    sa "没人骗你。是的，我们昨天在这里办了万圣节派对，因为很明显的原因，你没被邀请。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:515
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_b1b273c4:

    # dw "And you tricked us into going on Arieth's road trip to get rid of us. Admit it."
    dw "你就是故意让我们去Arieth的公路旅行，好甩掉我们。承认吧。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:517
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_75c171b7:

    # sa "Quinn?"
    sa "Quinn？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:519
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_1035bdde:

    # qu "If you are stupid enough to fall for it, you deserve it."
    qu "如果你蠢到上当，那只能怪你自己。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:521
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_ae659a06:

    # sa "Quinn!"
    sa "Quinn！"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:523
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_f5e2997e:

    # dw "I knew it!"
    dw "我知道了！"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:525
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_0be8308e:

    # qu "I don't get why we're tiptoeing around this at this point. You know we party with the DIKs."
    qu "我就不明白现在为啥还要绕弯子。你他妈知道我们跟DIKs一起嗨的。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:527
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_a5f831e1:

    # dw "There are traditions between the tri-alphas and the HOTs that you can't shit on like that!"
    dw "我们和HOTs之间有传统，你他妈的别这么轻视！"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:528
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_6e53e9e3:

    # dw "The HOTs have always been our sorority. End of story!"
    dw "HOTs一直都是我们的姐妹会。完事了。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:530
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_7fc57809:

    # tm "And now they aren't. Fucking deal with it!"
    tm "现在他们不是了。操，你得接受这个现实！"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:532
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_d5d898e5:

    # dw "I'm gonna deal with your face!"
    dw "我他妈的要让你好看！"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:534
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_b792de47:

    # sa "Calm down!"
    sa "冷静点！"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:535
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_12634fcc:

    # sa "We wanted to do this in a civil manner, didn't we?"
    sa "我们是想以文明的方式解决这件事，对吧？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:536
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_2376b339:

    # sa "Civil. As in no more fights. No more ruined properties and removed presidents. Right?"
    sa "文明。就像不再有打架。不再有被毁坏的财产和被罢免的主席。对吧？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:538
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_bd86694b:

    # dw "You girls are breaking the rules we have."
    dw "你们几个在破坏我们定下的规矩。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:540
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_c1402f80:

    # qu "There are no fucking rules about this. Get real!"
    qu "这里根本没有他妈的规矩。醒醒吧！"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:542
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_f125103e:

    # dw "Alumni would tell you differently! Some rules are unwritten."
    dw "校友们可不这么认为！有些规矩是不成文的。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:544
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_f3050c8a:

    # sa "We need to settle this once and for all. Look, we can't keep doing this crap you guys are doing."
    sa "我们得彻底解决这件事。听着，我们不能再这样下去了，你们干的那些事简直没法忍。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:545
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_a98c1d0c:

    # sa "We all have to agree that sometimes we party with each other and other times we don't."
    sa "我们得达成一致，有时候我们互相聚会，有时候又不聚。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:547
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_089ac972:

    # dw "And who decides that?"
    dw "谁来决定的？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:548
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_80af496e:

    # dw "I bet you wouldn't be partying with the DIKs if you put it to a vote."
    dw "我敢打赌，要是真拿去投票，你也不会和DIKs们一起参加派对。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:550
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_d935b3a9:

    # tm "That's not the first thing you're wrong about."
    tm "这可不是你第一次说错话。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:552
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_f9f301ad:

    # dw "We want the HOTs! And that's that."
    dw "我们要的是HOTs！就这么定了。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:553
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_8e9ae00d:

    # dw "If you try to take them from us, you better be prepared because we will take this fight up another notch."
    dw "如果你敢动他们一根手指头，那我保证你会见识到什么叫真正的狠劲。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:555
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_c5865a39:

    # tm "And I'll shove my fist so far up your ass that you'd probably enjoy it!"
    tm "我他妈的会把拳头塞得这么深进你屁股里，你大概率会乐在其中！"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:557
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_06c099c2:

    # sa "GUYS! ENOUGH!"
    sa "伙计们！够了！"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:559
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_18424e40:

    # sa "The HOTs have a say in this, too. This is not the tri-alphas' call or the DIKs' call; it's our joint call."
    sa "热浪们也得说话，这事儿不是三阿尔法或者DIKs能决定的，这是我们的共同决定。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:560
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_f98e2d36:

    # sa "We will respect our traditions because that's our duty as presidents."
    sa "我们会尊重我们的传统，因为这是作为会长的责任。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:562
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_f3ad3ebd:

    # dw "You're goddamned right about that."
    dw "你他妈说得对。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:564
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_576f3770:

    # sa "But! We will also make new traditions for the future by partying with the DIKs."
    sa "但！我们也会通过和DIKs一起狂欢来为未来创造新的传统。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:565
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_487eba4b:

    # sa "And the HOTs will decide how to do it. Not you."
    sa "而HOTs会决定怎么做。不是你。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:567
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_85a94e8a:

    # tm "That's not good enough."
    tm "这还不够好。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:569
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_8a5647f0:

    # dw "Yeah, that sucks balls!"
    dw "这他妈真他妈糟透了！"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:571
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_502c24cc:

    # tm "We should get the HOTs more than these guys. Everyone knows our parties are the shit."
    tm "我们应该多拉拢HOTs，而不是这些家伙。大家都知道我们的派对才是最牛逼的。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:573
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_bdb09ffc:

    # dw "There's no way we would agree to that. No chance in hell!"
    dw "我们怎么可能同意这种事？绝不可能！"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:574
translate schinese ep10_fr1_sage_event_label_46e64c25:

    # dw "And our parties are the bomb! There are beers and chicks everywhere!"
    dw "我们的派对太他妈棒了！到处都是啤酒和妞！"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:575
