translate schinese ep10_fr1_qc_event_label_dfdb2483:

    # cam "Did we really need to have all these pumpkins for the party?"
    cam "我们真的需要这么多南瓜来办派对吗？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1622
translate schinese ep10_fr1_qc_event_label_90da0235:

    # qu "Quit your bitching. Think of it as cardio. Chop chop!"
    qu "别抱怨了。想成健身。快点快点！"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1624
translate schinese ep10_fr1_qc_event_label_95789d52:

    # mc "Are you guys taking care of the pumpkins?"
    mc "你们在处理南瓜的事吗？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1626
translate schinese ep10_fr1_qc_event_label_608b7169:

    # qu "Something like that."
    qu "差不多这样。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1628
translate schinese ep10_fr1_qc_event_label_c4781c41:

    # mc "Cool. I'm collecting cups, cans, and bottles. Have you seen any around here?"
    mc "好，我正在收集杯子、罐子和瓶子。你们这边看到什么了吗？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1630
translate schinese ep10_fr1_qc_event_label_6ee2912f:

    # qu "There should be shitloads on the roof."
    qu "屋顶上应该堆了不少。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1633
translate schinese ep10_fr1_qc_event_label_b9ca37af:

    # mc "Thanks. I got those already."
    mc "谢谢。我那些已经搞定了。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1635
translate schinese ep10_fr1_qc_event_label_a772ab70:

    # mc "Thanks. I'll get to them later."
    mc "谢谢。我待会儿再去处理。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1639
translate schinese ep10_fr1_qc_event_label_ab1750dc:

    # mc "About earlier... I know you don't like talking about feelings and PDA. I'm sorry if I pushed you."
    mc "关于之前的事……我知道你不太喜欢谈感情和公开示爱，如果我让你不舒服了，我道歉。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1640
translate schinese ep10_fr1_qc_event_label_c7d52be7:

    # mc "I guess we're at different places when it comes to...well, us. I'm not saying there is an \"us\", but if there is...you know?"
    mc "我想我们在这段关系上可能处在不同的阶段。我不是说我们之间有“我们”，但如果有的话……你懂的？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1641
translate schinese ep10_fr1_qc_event_label_8105d14d:

    # mc "I'm not gonna rush it if it's moving too fast for you. But let me just say last night with you was amazing."
    mc "我不会逼你，如果感觉太快了就慢慢来。不过我想说，昨晚和你在一起真的很棒。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1643
translate schinese ep10_fr1_qc_event_label_caa8a9cc:

    # qu "I didn't want to talk about this back there, and I don't want to talk about it now. Can we forget it happened?"
    qu "我不想在那时候谈这个，现在也不想谈。我们能不能把它忘了？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1645
translate schinese ep10_fr1_qc_event_label_1bc7e515:

    # mc "No, we can't. But I'll shut up until you feel more comfortable talking about it."
    mc "不，我们不能。但我会闭嘴，直到你感觉更舒服能谈谈这件事。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1647
translate schinese ep10_fr1_qc_event_label_f1d93ff7:

    # qu "Shut up forever, then."
    qu "闭嘴，永远别再提了。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1650
translate schinese ep10_fr1_qc_event_label_5efb44f0:

    # mc "I can't believe that Halloween is over. It came and went fast as fuck."
    mc "真不敢相信万圣节就这么结束了。来得快去得也快，简直跟他妈的闪电一样。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1652
translate schinese ep10_fr1_qc_event_label_e024f27a:

    # mc "I can't believe that Halloween is over. All that planning and preparation and it's gone in an instant."
    mc "真他妈想不到万圣节就这么结束了。那么多准备和筹划，结果转眼就没了。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1654
translate schinese ep10_fr1_qc_event_label_837e887c:

    # qu "There will be more parties soon."
    qu "很快就会有更多派对了。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1656
translate schinese ep10_fr1_qc_event_label_47a0ce01:

    # mc "Yeah? Like what? Christmas?"
    mc "你是指像圣诞节那样的？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1658
translate schinese ep10_fr1_qc_event_label_d7189abf:

    # qu "You can throw a party any day of the week if you want. It doesn't have to be during holidays. You get that, right?"
    qu "你要是想办派对，随时都能办。不一定非得在节假日。你明白吧？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1660
translate schinese ep10_fr1_qc_event_label_379ef107:

    # qu "But Thanksgiving is coming up, and you guys have that DIKs' Thanksgiving party."
    qu "不过感恩节快到了，你们还有那DIKs的感恩节聚会。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1662
translate schinese ep10_fr1_qc_event_label_c17ef8ec:

    # mc "What's that?"
    mc "这是什么？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1664
translate schinese ep10_fr1_qc_event_label_4f7abb7d:

    # qu "The one where the latest maggots thank their DIK elders by throwing them a dinner party or something."
    qu "就是那些新家伙们在感恩节的时候，用一顿晚饭什么的来感谢咱们这些老成员的聚会。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1665
translate schinese ep10_fr1_qc_event_label_0d35b48e:

    # qu "You'd have to ask Tommy about it; I don't know the details."
    qu "你得去问Tommy，我可不知道细节。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1669
translate schinese ep10_fr1_qc_event_label_9ece490c:

    # qu "You're good at fighting, right?"
    qu "你打架挺在行的，对吧？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1671
translate schinese ep10_fr1_qc_event_label_c78e9a54:

    # mc "I'm pretty good at it. Why?"
    mc "我挺擅长的。怎么了？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1673
translate schinese ep10_fr1_qc_event_label_c2a3bfb5:

    # qu "Just checking."
    qu "随便看看。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1674
translate schinese ep10_fr1_qc_event_label_b336cb0b:

    # qu "If you're free sometime next week, I'd like to borrow you."
    qu "如果你下周有空，我想借你一下。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1675
translate schinese ep10_fr1_qc_event_label_87f2da8d:

    # qu "I've got something to do downtown and could use some company."
    qu "我在市中心有点事，正好想找个人陪我。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1677
translate schinese ep10_fr1_qc_event_label_fc29b8a3:

    # mc "Sure. What are we doing?"
    mc "好，有什么安排？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1679
translate schinese ep10_fr1_qc_event_label_fc921580:

    # qu "Hanging out and such."
    qu "溜达溜达，搞点事情。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1681
translate schinese ep10_fr1_qc_event_label_0eff34a7:

    # mc "Alright, I'm game."
    mc "好啊，我随时奉陪。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1683
translate schinese ep10_fr1_qc_event_label_7eb3070a:

    # qu "Awesome."
    qu "棒极了。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1686
translate schinese ep10_fr1_qc_event_label_66ec7017:

    # cam "Quinn? A little help?"
    cam "Quinn？来帮个忙？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1688
translate schinese ep10_fr1_qc_event_label_57d6a518:

    # qu "*{i}Sigh{/i}* You two can't do anything, can you?"
    qu "*{i}叹气{/i}* 你们俩什么事都办不成，是吧？"

